  sig=int
  doc=SemanticStallSimilarityPct is the word-overlap threshold (0–100) at which\ntwo consecutive tool-call batches at the SAME operation (same tool shape +\nsame target identifiers) are treated as a no-progress repeat even when\ntheir argument WORDING differs — so a cosmetic reword cannot defeat the\nstall guard. The repeat counter still trips at NoProgressStall. 0 disables\nsemantic detection (exact batch-signature matching only — legacy behavior).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/config.Config

